NAME = Apixaban_10DMF_XTB_preequil_confined.inp
|  1> # Apixaban + 10 DMF: XTB2 MD, spherical confinement
|  2> # Analogous to the other Apixaban Explicit10 confined XTB2 MD runs
|  3> # (Apixaban/Water/MD/Apixaban_10H2O_XTB_preequil_confined.inp,
|  4> #  Apixaban/DMSO/MD/10/Apixaban_10DMSO_XTB_preequil_confined.inp,
|  5> #  Apixaban/MeOH/MD/10/Apixaban_10MeOH_XTB_preequil_confined.inp,
|  6> #  Apixaban/Chloroform/MD/10/Apixaban_10CHCl3_XTB_preequil_confined.inp).
|  7> #
|  8> # UPDATED: now uses the real DMF-optimized Apixaban geometry
|  9> #   (Apixaban_SMD_dmf_Opt_Freq_KeepDens.xyz, r2SCAN-3c/SMD(dmf), converged,
| 10> #   no imaginary frequency, E = -1542.152113 Eh) instead of the earlier
| 11> #   placeholder (DMSO-optimized geometry). The Apixaban centroid/size came
| 12> #   out essentially identical to the other solvents' (Apixaban's own
| 13> #   conformation barely changes between continuum solvents), so the 10 DMF
| 14> #   placement and Cell Sphere parameters below are unchanged.
| 15> #
| 16> # Starting geometry: Apixaban (59 atoms, SMD(dmf)-optimized) + 10 DMF
| 17> #   molecules, each placed with its carbonyl O atom (the primary H-bond
| 18> #   acceptor site) on the same 12-direction sphere-shell pattern used
| 19> #   throughout this project, rotated so the molecule's bulk (the two methyl
| 20> #   groups) points radially outward.
| 21> #
| 22> # Apixaban centroid = (31.537, -19.865, -0.109); max atom-centroid distance
| 23> #   = 9.03 Ang (consistent with the other Apixaban Explicit10 builds).
| 24> # DMF's own extent from its O reference atom = 4.31 Ang.
| 25> # 10 DMF molecules placed at offset 12.78 Ang from Apixaban's centroid (the
| 26> #   same offset reused throughout this project for Apixaban-scale builds).
| 27> # Cell Sphere radius set to 18.0 Ang (larger than DMSO/CHCl3's 14.0 Ang,
| 28> #   since DMF's own molecular extent (4.31 Ang) is bigger than DMSO's
| 29> #   (3.78 Ang), and the original 14.0 Ang sphere was already found in
| 30> #   earlier fixes to be too tight even for DMSO at this offset).
| 31> # Checked: min DMF-Apixaban atom distance = 4.16 Ang (no clash), max atom
| 32> #   distance from the sphere center = 17.09 Ang (safely inside the 18.0 Ang
| 33> #   sphere). Total atom count = 179 (59 + 10x12), verified.
| 34> 
| 35> ! XTB2 MD
| 36> 
| 37> %md
| 38>   Timestep 1.0_fs
| 39>   Initvel 298.15_K
| 40>   Thermostat NHC 298.15_K Timecon 20.0_fs
